' =====================================================================
' SIMAFTUNSUR — Sequence Diagram integrasi ML <-> Sistem Informasi
' (PlantUML, latar putih). Padanan render dari sequence Mermaid di
' docs/bab2-scikit-learn-integrasi.md.
' =====================================================================

@startuml Integrasi-Laravel-Python-Sequence
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI

actor "Pengguna\n(Staf WD III)" as P
participant "SIMAFTUNSUR\n(Laravel)" as L
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Layanan Klasterisasi\n(FastAPI + scikit-learn)" as ML

P -> L : Klik "Jalankan Klasterisasi"
L -> DB : Ambil mahasiswa layak\n(aktif, >= 3 catatan IPK)
DB --> L : Data mahasiswa + riwayat\nIPK/prestasi/kegiatan/pengabdian
L -> L : Susun snapshot 7 fitur per mahasiswa
L -> ML : POST /klasterisasi\n(JSON: data, k_min=2, k_max=8, skema penskalaan)
activate ML
ML -> ML : Praproses -> StandardScaler ->\nloop k=2..8 (K-Means + WCSS + Silhouette + DBI)\n-> pilih k -> model final -> interpretasi + PCA
ML --> L : JSON: label klaster per mahasiswa, centroid,\nmetrik, evaluasi per-k, koordinat PCA
deactivate ML
L -> DB : Simpan dalam 1 transaksi:\neksekusi, klaster, anggota
L --> P : Dashboard hasil\n(metrik, profil klaster, sebaran PCA)
@enduml
